Fragment identifier considerations: No fragment identifier semantics are defined for this media type. Fragment identifiers are not applicable to this format, and any fragment included in a URI referencing a resource of this type SHOULD be ignored by the user agent.

Restrictions on usage: None. This media type is a general-purpose container format and is not restricted to any specific application, operating system, or network environment. Implementers should note that the underlying 7z compression format is publicly available and imposes no known patent or licensing restrictions for typical use.

